          "text": "又是个恐怖游戏？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:day2_extra:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_0": {
        "id": "line_0",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "今天玩什么？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_0:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_1": {
        "id": "line_1",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "一个我淘来的小众桌游，你们肯定会喜欢的。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_1:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_2": {
        "id": "line_2",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "“一边调查犯人，一边调和防腐剂处理尸体……”怎么是关于尸体的游戏？",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_2:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_3": {
        "id": "line_3",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "彬彬",
          "text": "你不喜欢吗？多刺激啊。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_3:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_3": {
        "id": "game_time_3",
        "type": "framework:consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_4": {
        "id": "line_4",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "……不喜欢。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_4:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_5": {
        "id": "line_5",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "我来发牌了，身份牌可不要让别人看到哦~",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_5:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_6": {
        "id": "line_6",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "*游戏进行中",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_6:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_6": {
        "id": "game_time_6",
        "type": "framework:consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_7": {
        "id": "line_7",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "彬彬",
          "text": "大家都是希望能够调和成功的好人呢……",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_7:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_8": {
        "id": "line_8",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "是吗？我看不一定。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_8:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_9": {
        "id": "line_9",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "你们为什么都质疑我？我不是……但有人是叛徒。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_9:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_9": {
        "id": "game_time_9",
        "type": "framework:consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_10": {
        "id": "line_10",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "彬彬",
          "text": "我们中有叛徒？这个人不是我。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_10:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_11": {
        "id": "line_11",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "也不是我。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_11:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_12": {
        "id": "line_12",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "嘘嘘，不能透露身份。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_12:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_12": {
        "id": "game_time_12",
        "type": "framework:consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_13": {
        "id": "line_13",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "到了揭露谜底的时候了——",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_13:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_14": {
        "id": "line_14",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "你们三个居然都是坏人！只有我真的在调和防腐药剂！",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_14:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_15": {
        "id": "line_15",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "彬彬",
          "text": "抱歉呢主控，看来尸体会无可避免地腐烂了呢。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_15:continue"
        }
      },
      "game_time_15": {
        "id": "game_time_15",
        "type": "framework:consumeTime",
        "inputs": {
          "minutes": 20
        }
      },
      "line_16": {
        "id": "line_16",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿伟",
          "text": "真正的犯人也没有抓到。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_16:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_17": {
        "id": "line_17",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "阿杰",
          "text": "运气不好啊优等生。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_17:continue"
        }
      },
      "line_18": {
        "id": "line_18",
        "type": "text",
        "inputs": {
          "displayTo": "dorm-bottom",
          "speaker": "主控",
          "text": "……以后不想再玩这种输了会做噩梦的游戏了。",
          "continueKey": "dlg:line_18:continue"
        }
      },
